Response package (DTOs) dependencies:

Depends on: Model (maps fields from entities)
Does NOT depend on: Repository, Controller, Config

Who depends on Response/DTO:

Service → builds DTOs from entities before returning
Controller → returns DTOs (not raw entities) to the client

Why it exists:

Hides internal fields (password hashes, etc.)
Avoids infinite recursion from bidirectional entity relationships
Decouples API shape from DB schema

Service → builds → Response DTO → returned by Controller